WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.320
and switch it, nice deep squat, bring one leg up,

2
00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:06.980
reach out towards those toes, squat down again,

3
00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:08.900
then bring that opposite leg up, just keep alternating

4
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:11.040
back and forth between those legs every single time

5
00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:14.020
you squat, try to get a nice deep squat every single time.

6
00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:16.660
You want to try to get those hips down below those knees,

7
00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.560
warm those knees up, warm that hip socket up.

8
00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:21.640
Now you also want to get a nice stretch on that hamstring

9
00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:23.820
every single time, so make sure you're really reaching down

10
00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:25.180
towards that toe.

11
00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:26.820
We're gonna switch off to the next exercise here

12
00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:29.140
in just a second, we're doing line jumps next.

13
00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:34.320
Just a couple seconds left, and switch it.

14
00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:36.360
Just imagine while you're doing this exercise,

15
00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:38.340
you're trying to get those feet up and over,

16
00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:41.280
either a really tall log or a really high band,

17
00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:42.940
and you're trying to let those feet touch the ground

18
00:00:42.940 --> 00:00:44.720
for as short a period of time as possible

19
00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:46.960
before jumping back over to the other side.

20
00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:48.600
Just keep moving as quickly as you can,

21
00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:50.840
driving those knees up as high as you can.

22
00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:51.920
Now remember, this is our warm-up,

23
00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:53.160
so we're trying to get that heart rate up,

24
00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:54.740
we're trying to get that core temperature up,

25
00:00:54.740 --> 00:00:56.600
so keep pushing through it.

26
00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:58.200
Got just a few more seconds, then we're gonna switch

27
00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:00.480
to just regular jumping jacks, this is our last exercise,

28
00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:01.320
we're doing it.
